@startuml seq_open_load
title Sequence - Open load detection, fault reaction, diagnostic DTC (Golden Thread)

participant "LED_Driver_Stage_1" as DRV
participant "Current_Sense_Chain\nSM-01" as CS
participant "SWC_LightManager" as LM
participant "SWC_DiagnosticManager" as DM
participant "Vehicle_Gateway" as GW
actor "Driver" as D

== Normal operation ==
LM -> DRV : PWM 400 Hz, enable
DRV -> CS : shunt voltage
CS -> LM : I_load = 1.20 A (PWM-synchronous, 2.5 ms raster)

== Fault occurs: open load ==
DRV -> CS : shunt voltage ~ 0
CS -> LM : I_load < 150 mA
note right of LM
  t = 0 ms   fault occurs
  qualification window 50 ms
  debounce            20 ms
  sync + acquisition   2.6 ms
  task latency         5 ms
end note
LM -> LM : classify "open load"\n(SYS-REQ-014) at t <= 80 ms
LM -> CS : off-phase zero check (HW-REQ-005)
CS --> LM : sense chain healthy
LM -> DRV : keep remaining channel,\nreduce set point
note right of LM : safe state reached\nat t <= 230 ms < FTTI 300 ms
LM -> DM : set DTC "low beam ch.1 open load"
LM -> GW : DriverWarningReq = lowBeamFault
GW -> D : warning in instrument cluster (<= 2 s)

== Workshop ==
participant "Diagnostic tester" as T
T -> DM : UDS 0x19 read DTC
DM --> T : DTC + snapshot (<= 100 ms)
@enduml
